  "descriptionProcessing": "We combined the source's \"Turkey in Europe\" and \"Turkey in Asia\" series into a single series for Turkey, and used the source's Great Britain series to extend the United Kingdom series before 1930. People not attributed to a listed country are assigned to a \"(not specified)\" entity of their region, so all entities together add up to the source's total.",
